    <string name="bs_welcome_title">Welcome to Banafsh-sstp</string>
    <string name="bs_about_title">About Banafsh-sstp</string>
    <string name="bs_dont_show_again">Don\'t show this message again</string>
    <string name="bs_welcome_message">This app is not a standalone VPN. It works with configs that you enter or choose inside it.\n\nTo get started easily, tap “Choose a free server” on the main screen and pick a server.\n\nThe free servers are refreshed automatically every few hours. They are shared by volunteers, mostly in Japan, so speed may drop or the connection may sometimes fail.\n\nPlease do not use this service to log in to important or banking accounts.\n\nThis app was made by ARASH-BANAFSHX, based on Open SSTP Client by kittoku.\n\nTelegram channel: https://t.me/Banafsh_sstp</string>
    <string name="bs_features_title">What\'s new and features</string>
    <string name="bs_whats_new_title">What\'s new in %1$s</string>
    <string name="bs_features_list">• A fresh, more attractive and easier look, with a big Connect/Disconnect button on the main screen\n\n• Free servers with automatic testing: every server is tested from your own internet. A green light means it works, red means it is unreachable. Working servers are sorted by ping; a lower ping usually means more speed and stability, so the server at the top is usually the best choice\n\n• Automatic reconnection (on by default): if the connection drops suddenly, for example in the middle of a call or when the network changes, the app reconnects by itself\n\n• Iranian apps, file-sharing apps (like Quick Share and ShareIt) and mail apps work directly without the VPN; their list updates automatically\n\n• Persian and English with a language option in Settings, plus light and dark themes\n\n• Simple Settings with a collapsible Advanced section for power users\n\n• Save, load, import and export profiles</string>
